sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pesquisador
    participant FE as useMolecularDynamicsPage
    participant R as routes/molecular_dynamics.py
    participant UC as usecases/molecular_dynamics.py
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant W as _dh_md_worker
    participant DH as DrugHunter MDSimulator (OpenMM)
    participant WA as _dh_md_analyser_worker

    U->>FE: Escolhe consenso, ligante (mol2) e receptor
    FE->>R: GET /consensus/{id}/ligantes e /receptores
    opt Arquivos próprios
        FE->>R: POST /upload/ligante ou /upload/receptor
    end
    FE->>R: POST /iniciar (params MD)
    R->>UC: uc_iniciar_md
    UC->>DB: cria md_jobs (pending)
    UC->>W: thread → _executar_md → worker
    DB-->>UC: running
    W->>DH: prepare_ligand e prepare_receptor
    W->>DH: build_forcefield_system e solvatação
    W->>DH: md_simulation (NPT, produção em ns)
    DH-->>W: complex_min.pdb e trajectory.dcd
    W-->>UC: done
    UC->>DB: done + e-mail
    loop A cada 10 s
        FE->>R: GET /job/{id}
    end
    FE->>R: GET /job/{id}/download/trajectory.dcd
    FE->>FE: NGL reproduz a trajetória em 3D
    U->>FE: Analisar trajetória
    FE->>R: POST /job/{id}/analyse
    R->>UC: cria md_analysis_jobs
    UC->>WA: thread → execute_md_analisys
    WA-->>UC: RMSD, RMSF, Rg, ligações de hidrogênio, PLIP
    FE->>R: GET /analysis/files e /analysis/view/...
